    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d161">

                <pb facs="0390" n="76" xml:id="pg76"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 124.551/12</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Belgium</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Whitlock</hi>)</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-25T15:00:00-05:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">August 25, 1914, 3 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Your August 19, 6 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d161-f1"/> Department must be guided
                    by your judgment as to whether it is advisable to move Legation from Brussels to
                    Antwerp.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
